WEBVTT

00:01.147 --> 00:06.067
I spent two entire years in a room 
at the Blue Crystals guild hall.

00:07.147 --> 00:10.287
The last time I left that 
building was two years ago.

00:10.287 --> 00:12.687
You didn't set one foot 
outside in two years?

00:12.687 --> 00:13.907
Th-That's right!

00:14.887 --> 00:18.037
I can't fight anymore.

00:19.037 --> 00:20.727
Not since that day two years ago

00:20.727 --> 00:25.187
when I failed a quest for the 
first time and nearly died.

00:26.017 --> 00:31.267
Just thinking I'm about to fight makes 
my breath short and my hands shake.

00:31.827 --> 00:34.267
I can't even hold a sword anymore.

00:34.647 --> 00:37.767
You wouldn't understand, Rein!

00:37.987 --> 00:40.067
Then why did you come?

00:40.067 --> 00:41.857
Sh-Shut up!

00:41.857 --> 00:43.507
If you keep talking, I'll kill you!

00:43.507 --> 00:45.597
But we're supposed to kill a dragon.

00:45.597 --> 00:47.627
Seriously, shut up!

00:49.607 --> 00:51.257
There's a pretty bird.

00:51.257 --> 00:52.037
Huh?

00:56.187 --> 00:58.037
That's a dragon!

01:12.977 --> 01:15.607
THE LAID-OFF CHEAT-GRANTING MAGE
ENJOYS A SECOND LEASE ON LIFE

02:40.817 --> 02:44.097
It's coming. Rein, run—

02:45.697 --> 02:47.317
Wh-What are you doing?!

02:47.317 --> 02:49.277
You confirmed it yourself.

02:49.567 --> 02:51.277
These clothes are enchanted.

02:51.677 --> 02:54.167
A little enchantment won't 
protect you from a drag—

02:54.167 --> 02:55.407
It's okay.

02:55.687 --> 02:58.507
Just stay behind me.

03:01.097 --> 03:03.937
DASH

03:01.297 --> 03:03.517
Let's go!

03:05.297 --> 03:07.547
Look, there's a pretty bird.

03:07.547 --> 03:09.337
I can't trust you!

03:09.337 --> 03:13.267
Calm down, Lily. Dragons aren't scary.

03:13.267 --> 03:15.007
You're way scarier than a dragon!

03:15.007 --> 03:17.217
You're a madman!

04:05.157 --> 04:06.717
It went away.

04:06.717 --> 04:08.697
It'll come right back.

04:08.697 --> 04:10.857
Anyway, what did you do just now?

04:11.127 --> 04:13.237
I blocked it with my clothes.

04:13.237 --> 04:15.777
I'm telling you, they're incredible armor.

04:17.377 --> 04:19.397
I'll handle the attacking, too.

04:19.397 --> 04:23.457
I'll hit that dragon with this sword.

04:24.127 --> 04:25.507
It's so dinky.

04:27.447 --> 04:28.747
Don't be scared.

04:29.337 --> 04:32.627
I'll defeat the dragon!

04:36.147 --> 04:36.937
Huh?

04:41.847 --> 04:46.347
<i>I still can't hold a 
sword in this situation.</i>

04:47.207 --> 04:50.937
<i>I could easily defeat that 
dragon if I weren't afraid.</i>

04:51.987 --> 04:54.857
Sorry for making you anxious, Lily.

04:55.467 --> 04:59.267
I'll block its flames with my armor, 
and I'll keep attacking until I hit it.

05:00.027 --> 05:00.957
Seriously?

05:01.877 --> 05:05.527
You're a clueless amateur. 
What are you showing off for?

05:06.337 --> 05:10.067
<i>I'm... I'm better than this!</i>

05:12.297 --> 05:14.907
<i>I should be able to do anything!</i>

05:14.907 --> 05:15.917
Lily?

05:16.167 --> 05:18.527
It'll keep dodging you from this distance!

05:18.527 --> 05:19.747
Let it get closer!

05:19.747 --> 05:21.677
Don't rush! Be patient and wait!

05:21.677 --> 05:23.307
O-Okay.

05:23.307 --> 05:25.557
If you don't get it this time, it's over!

05:25.557 --> 05:29.107
This is the last time you'll block 
its attack with those clothes!

05:30.057 --> 05:32.877
Otherwise, we'll lose!

05:33.547 --> 05:37.617
Okay. I don't really get it, 
but if you say so, I believe you.

05:42.907 --> 05:43.577
Now!

06:07.027 --> 06:08.937
That was crazy.

06:09.257 --> 06:11.107
You're the reason we won, Lily.

06:11.357 --> 06:12.187
Thanks.

06:13.067 --> 06:14.867
Uh, you're welcome.

06:15.997 --> 06:18.697
<i>I defeated a dragon with this sword.</i>

06:19.057 --> 06:21.487
<i>I really can fight.</i>

06:23.557 --> 06:24.917
It broke.

06:24.917 --> 06:29.707
Enhancing its attack doesn't 
enhance its durability.

06:31.047 --> 06:33.087
Whoa! My clothes, too!

06:33.087 --> 06:37.297
When you said that was the last time 
I'd block its flames with my clothes—

06:37.297 --> 06:38.467
Stay away!

06:49.587 --> 06:50.807
Why'd you go back to sleep?!

06:52.237 --> 06:53.057
Lily.

06:55.337 --> 07:01.537
What I'm about to say is just 
me talking nonsense in my sleep.

07:02.417 --> 07:05.687
You said the Blue Crystals 
would be criticized if I died

07:05.687 --> 07:09.077
trying to slay the dragon by myself.

07:09.077 --> 07:12.207
Maybe I did, maybe I didn't.

07:12.557 --> 07:17.147
If you, an S-rank adventurer, 
came with me, and we both died,

07:17.147 --> 07:22.517
people would assume the dragon 
was just really strong.

07:23.997 --> 07:31.727
Then the Blue Crystals would 
be protected from criticism.

07:32.037 --> 07:34.257
Since you can't fight right now,

07:34.257 --> 07:37.837
you can only be useful by 
throwing your life away.

07:38.277 --> 07:41.537
I think that was your plan.

07:42.747 --> 07:47.457
But the Blue Crystals wouldn't 
want you to do that.

07:48.287 --> 07:54.797
You throwing your life away would make 
them sadder than being criticized.

07:57.647 --> 07:59.687
I was wondering what you'd say.

07:59.687 --> 08:02.007
It really was just nonsense.

08:02.547 --> 08:03.757
Really?

08:06.487 --> 08:14.337
Th-The Blue Crystals took me in when 
I was worthless and unable to fight,

08:14.857 --> 08:19.237
so today, I...

08:21.777 --> 08:24.437
I wanted to do something for them.

08:25.837 --> 08:27.047
I'm sorry.

08:29.197 --> 08:30.287
I know.

08:31.637 --> 08:35.017
I swear I'll be able to 
fight again someday,

08:35.537 --> 08:40.727
so don't tell anyone about today.

08:41.517 --> 08:43.327
Okay, sure.

08:51.467 --> 08:55.437
Your boobs and thighs 
are so soft! Best ever!

08:55.437 --> 08:57.517
I didn't let you touch my breasts!

08:57.517 --> 08:58.967
Ow! Your fists are hard!

08:58.147 --> 08:59.777
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

08:59.777 --> 09:01.437
You jerk! Jerk! Jerk! Jerk! Jerk!

09:04.377 --> 09:08.697
Lily, I can enchant my sword and armor,

09:09.287 --> 09:11.357
but I have no combat experience.

09:14.297 --> 09:17.777
So will you adventure with me?

09:18.787 --> 09:21.877
I need you right now.

09:28.787 --> 09:30.367
I'm looking forward to it, Rein.

09:33.897 --> 09:35.437
Well, well...

09:36.187 --> 09:39.147
I didn't need to keep an eye on them.

09:39.717 --> 09:40.527
Time to go.

09:42.487 --> 09:47.277
Nice! I got a whole 700 points 
from that mid-level dragon!

09:47.767 --> 09:51.157
So, what should we do with its body?

09:51.537 --> 09:53.697
Let a dissector handle it.

09:53.697 --> 09:55.437
A dissector!

09:55.437 --> 09:56.827
Then let's head back and—

09:56.827 --> 09:57.707
We can't.

09:57.377 --> 09:59.647
What?! Why not, Lily?!

09:58.097 --> 09:59.937
Night will fall before we get back.

09:59.647 --> 10:00.997
C'mon, c'mon, Lily!

09:59.937 --> 10:03.127
I brought what we need,
so let's camp out somewhere.

10:00.997 --> 10:03.707
C'mon, Lily! Lily, Lily!

10:06.847 --> 10:09.297
Look at it burn!

10:09.587 --> 10:13.557
<i>Why is he having so much fun?</i>

10:13.557 --> 10:16.807
Lily, I'm happy I got to be an adventurer.

10:16.807 --> 10:18.687
It's so much fun.

10:19.357 --> 10:21.807
I see. So that's why.

10:21.807 --> 10:22.927
Why what?

10:23.637 --> 10:25.317
Nothing.

10:27.937 --> 10:28.817
Lily?

10:32.437 --> 10:33.327
Be on your guard.

10:34.327 --> 10:37.067
Four—no, six people are coming.

10:37.617 --> 10:38.307
Look.

10:39.267 --> 10:40.737
That's a nice spyglass.

10:40.737 --> 10:43.087
What are you looking at? Hurry up!

10:46.137 --> 10:50.467
Those are... Beast's Fangs adventurers.

10:50.467 --> 10:54.467
What? This'll be a pain.

10:54.467 --> 10:59.627
But they weren't around 
when I was kicked out.

11:00.617 --> 11:04.857
They might think I'm still a member.

11:05.167 --> 11:09.237
Really? In that case, 
let's pretend you are.

11:09.517 --> 11:13.867
No way! I'm a member of 
the Blue Crystals now!

11:14.097 --> 11:15.257
But if you tell them

11:15.257 --> 11:19.697
you dispelled the enchantments on 
their gear when you were kicked out,

11:19.697 --> 11:21.247
we'll just get into a fight.

11:21.917 --> 11:23.537
Yeah, but...

11:26.017 --> 11:27.127
L-Lily?!

11:27.457 --> 11:29.557
Why are you getting undressed?!

11:29.557 --> 11:32.427
They'll know I'm an adventurer 
if I'm dressed like this.

11:32.427 --> 11:34.617
I'm going to pretend 
I'm a regular city girl.

11:35.887 --> 11:38.007
So you brought a disguise?

11:41.717 --> 11:43.957
What? These are my regular clothes.

11:43.957 --> 11:45.977
Wow, they're so ugly!

11:45.977 --> 11:50.987
THE ENHANCED CLOTHES I WAS WEARING WERE DESTROYED
BY A DEVASTATING BLOW, AND A TRAUMATIZED GIRL
IN CASUAL CLOTHES HIT ME WITH ALL HER MIGHT.

11:52.027 --> 11:55.237
Hey, Rein. It's been a while.

11:55.587 --> 11:57.667
What brings you here?

11:57.667 --> 11:59.487
The third anniversary of my dad's death.

11:59.877 --> 12:03.237
My mom keeps bugging me to visit home,

12:03.237 --> 12:10.257
but whenever I do, she won't shut 
up about marriage and grandkids.

12:08.807 --> 12:10.257
What are you talking about?

12:11.057 --> 12:14.617
And you... You're not 
Lily Flambert, are you?

12:14.617 --> 12:18.277
No, though people say I look like her.

12:18.277 --> 12:20.687
Honestly, I'm sick of hearing it.

12:20.687 --> 12:23.757
Seriously, that Lily Flambert 
makes me want to puke!

12:24.137 --> 12:25.357
Yeah?

12:25.357 --> 12:28.147
Lily and I were classmates. 
She's attending the service with me.

12:29.937 --> 12:31.907
Your name is Lily, too?

12:31.907 --> 12:35.847
Y-Yeah, it is! That's why 
she pisses me off so much!

12:35.847 --> 12:40.157
That Lily may be an adventurer, 
but I'm just a regular city girl.

12:40.397 --> 12:44.717
I guess Lily Flambert wouldn't 
be hanging around here.

12:44.717 --> 12:46.017
Yeah.

12:46.017 --> 12:49.527
These days, I hear she trembles under 
the covers and pisses herself every day.

12:49.527 --> 12:50.377
H-Hey!

12:50.377 --> 12:52.087
Don't worry about me.

12:52.087 --> 12:52.797
But...

12:53.147 --> 12:54.627
Rein.

12:56.217 --> 12:58.297
Do you know these guys?

12:58.297 --> 12:59.677
No.

12:59.957 --> 13:04.717
We ran into these adventurers 
from some guild while questing.

13:04.717 --> 13:08.557
There were three more of them, 
but they pressed their luck,

13:08.557 --> 13:11.617
so they died while learning 
their lesson. Right?

13:13.317 --> 13:14.267
Yes, sir...

13:14.267 --> 13:17.027
Wh-What do you mean, they died?

13:17.287 --> 13:21.087
They look terrified.
Why don't you release them?

13:21.087 --> 13:23.827
I can't yet. Right?

13:26.317 --> 13:29.577
I can't take it anymore!

13:35.697 --> 13:37.197
I knew it.

13:38.417 --> 13:40.547
My bow's less powerful.

13:41.067 --> 13:43.307
By quite a bit, too.

13:43.637 --> 13:47.057
It's not just me. 
Their equipment is weaker, too.

13:47.887 --> 13:51.867
That's why we failed our quest.

13:53.677 --> 13:55.857
Well, screw this!

14:02.937 --> 14:05.447
I'm glad we ran into you, Rein.

14:05.897 --> 14:09.207
Could you enchant our weapons some more?

14:09.477 --> 14:11.707
I... I can't—

14:12.297 --> 14:15.697
For some reason, Rein can't 
enchant anything right now.

14:16.097 --> 14:17.717
What?

14:18.257 --> 14:20.317
Then you're useless.

14:20.317 --> 14:23.287
Why are you even alive?

14:23.287 --> 14:25.397
That's enough! I—

14:25.397 --> 14:26.177
Rein!

14:26.777 --> 14:28.597
You can't enchant their gear,

14:28.597 --> 14:32.667
but we can at least make up 
for it by burying the bodies.

14:32.667 --> 14:36.167
If we leave them here, the smell 
of blood will attract beasts.

14:36.787 --> 14:41.237
Smart girl. Need me to bury 
something in you, too?

14:41.527 --> 14:42.697
No, thank you.

14:44.737 --> 14:46.487
I like her.

14:46.997 --> 14:49.997
You should be more like 
Lily the city girl.

14:53.407 --> 14:55.497
Sorry, Lily.

14:55.827 --> 14:56.967
For what?

14:56.967 --> 15:00.217
Since I always worked at the guild hall,

15:00.217 --> 15:03.447
I didn't know they got up 
to that stuff out here.

15:03.447 --> 15:05.527
I dragged you into my business again.

15:06.287 --> 15:07.547
I'm pathetic.

15:07.547 --> 15:09.137
It's not your fault.

15:09.987 --> 15:11.137
Really?

15:11.377 --> 15:15.637
Yeah. I was a shut-in for two years.

15:15.637 --> 15:17.277
You know way more than I do.

15:18.817 --> 15:20.047
Yeah, for real.

15:21.067 --> 15:25.927
Wait, sorry! I was a shut-in 
for three—no, five years!

15:25.927 --> 15:28.707
What are you lying for? 
Are you <i>trying</i> to make me mad?

15:31.767 --> 15:34.727
That man looks pretty skilled.

15:34.727 --> 15:40.847
Yeah. Cornelius's gang is one of 
the Beast's Fangs' top three parties.

15:40.847 --> 15:44.007
Even if we beat them in a fight, 
there'd be consequences.

15:44.607 --> 15:45.677
Consequences?

15:45.927 --> 15:48.677
War between the Beast's 
Fangs and the Blue Crystals.

15:48.677 --> 15:52.187
We'd never win that fight.

15:55.037 --> 15:58.287
We have to put up with this for the 
sake of our fellow guild members.

16:00.967 --> 16:05.727
Lily... I guess being an 
adventurer isn't all fun, huh?

16:06.207 --> 16:10.177
Between the lying and putting up 
with crap, it's surprisingly tough.

16:11.937 --> 16:15.527
Hey, I brought that stuff! 
What do you think you're doing?!

16:15.527 --> 16:18.087
What do you mean? 
We found it lying around.

16:20.877 --> 16:21.707
Rein.

16:23.477 --> 16:26.217
Aren't you glad you joined 
the Blue Crystals?

16:28.077 --> 16:29.297
Yeah.

16:31.317 --> 16:33.097
That hurt! What was that for?

16:33.657 --> 16:37.287
Rein, we're taking your girl.

16:37.287 --> 16:39.117
Wh-What?!

16:39.117 --> 16:42.167
You couldn't enchant our gear,

16:42.167 --> 16:46.497
but we'll forgive you if 
you hand over the girl.

16:47.027 --> 16:49.127
Not a bad deal, right?

16:49.127 --> 16:52.287
Make the best choice for 
your guild and friends.

16:52.837 --> 16:54.287
My friends...

16:55.057 --> 16:57.827
In that case, the choice is obvious.

16:59.087 --> 17:01.087
You can't have Lily!

17:11.227 --> 17:12.517
What's wrong, Rein?

17:14.907 --> 17:16.517
ROLL ROLL ROLL ROLL

17:17.277 --> 17:19.467
That hurt! Why did you drop me?!

17:19.467 --> 17:23.477
Sorry. My arms got tired and gave out.

17:23.477 --> 17:25.297
You're heavier than I thought!

17:25.297 --> 17:27.157
Your arms are just scrawny!

17:30.097 --> 17:34.367
Lily, I can't hand you over 
just because they told me to.

17:35.177 --> 17:40.537
Your guild watched over you 
while you were a shut-in, right?

17:41.107 --> 17:42.377
If anything happened to you,

17:42.377 --> 17:46.377
they'd try to help you no 
matter the benefit or cost.

17:47.877 --> 17:50.267
Once Cornelius makes a decision, 
he can't be swayed.

17:50.607 --> 17:54.667
And I finally got my wish 
of becoming an adventurer.

17:55.687 --> 17:58.647
I don't want to lie. I want to be honest.

17:58.647 --> 18:00.737
You're still clinging to that?

18:00.737 --> 18:03.277
Hey, Rein!

18:03.277 --> 18:06.527
Don't bother running! 
You can't outrun my arrows!

18:08.907 --> 18:10.987
I have something to tell you!

18:10.987 --> 18:14.037
I'm not a member of the 
Beast's Fangs anymore!

18:14.037 --> 18:18.917
And I dispelled the enchantments 
on your weapons!

18:19.697 --> 18:21.417
You did what?

18:21.797 --> 18:24.997
You mean you're the reason 
we failed our quest?

18:24.997 --> 18:26.397
Who do you think we are?

18:26.397 --> 18:28.127
We'll teach you a lesson!

18:28.127 --> 18:29.297
Rein...

18:29.297 --> 18:33.097
It's okay. I've got a special weapon.

18:33.857 --> 18:34.807
These.

18:36.097 --> 18:38.347
Pebbles?

18:38.337 --> 18:39.387
Quit screwing around!

18:39.387 --> 18:41.307
That's never gonna work!

18:44.237 --> 18:45.877
The pebbles he threw...

18:45.877 --> 18:47.647
...exploded?!

18:47.647 --> 18:49.527
They didn't explode!

18:50.017 --> 18:53.207
I just enchanted some rocks! That's all!

18:54.977 --> 18:56.287
Whatever.

18:57.547 --> 18:59.787
We just have to dodge them.

19:03.647 --> 19:06.497
Oh, did you step on a pebble I threw?

19:07.597 --> 19:11.257
They're not just deadly when thrown. 
They hurt like caltrops when stepped on.

19:11.597 --> 19:13.747
They're not ordinary rocks anymore.

19:14.417 --> 19:15.927
<i>Rocks!</i>

19:16.507 --> 19:18.747
<i>As evident from rock-throwing,</i>

19:18.747 --> 19:23.767
<i>rocks are the cheapest and most savage 
of all weapons across all nations.</i>

19:24.087 --> 19:28.397
<i>Typically, rocks must be of a 
certain size to inflict damage,</i>

19:28.397 --> 19:31.377
<i>but with Rein's enchantments,</i>

19:31.377 --> 19:35.517
<i>even a useless pebble can 
be turned into a weapon.</i>

19:35.517 --> 19:37.367
I don't believe it.

19:37.407 --> 19:42.287
Your enchantments are this powerful?!

19:42.287 --> 19:46.667
I've still got all these 
enchanted rocks, too!

19:47.017 --> 19:51.937
If you come at me, I'll start 
throwing them, so shut up and go!

19:54.487 --> 19:56.617
They're heading straight home.

19:56.617 --> 19:59.497
I should retrieve my bonus 
points from the rocks!

20:01.697 --> 20:03.437
They crumbled.

20:03.967 --> 20:07.577
Looks like you'll need durable weapons.

20:07.577 --> 20:09.717
Durable weapons, huh?

20:09.717 --> 20:13.197
I doubt weapons like that 
will be easy to find.

20:13.667 --> 20:16.067
But this is a good problem to have.

20:17.437 --> 20:20.827
Worrying about what weapon I'll use 
feels like an adventurer's problem.

20:21.297 --> 20:24.277
I need to find one soon.

20:25.307 --> 20:27.587
I know a place...

20:28.667 --> 20:33.167
where we might find a sword that 
can endure your enchantments.

20:35.087 --> 20:36.227
What?

20:36.657 --> 20:39.097
What are you talking about?

20:39.097 --> 20:41.557
You gotta believe us, Guildmaster!

20:41.557 --> 20:43.307
It was Rein.

20:43.307 --> 20:46.687
Rein made us fail our quest.

20:46.907 --> 20:50.617
Him? I find that hard to believe.

20:50.937 --> 20:52.187
Guildmaster.

20:52.457 --> 20:54.827
I appraised their gear, and it's true.

20:56.327 --> 21:00.317
All their bonus points 
have been reduced to zero.

21:03.127 --> 21:07.707
I can't believe he could actually 
dispel his enchantments.

21:08.227 --> 21:10.727
Why are you just standing there?

21:10.727 --> 21:12.877
Go find Rein!

21:12.877 --> 21:16.227
If he's in a guild, find them, too!

21:16.227 --> 21:17.137
Yes, ma'am!

21:19.857 --> 21:20.817
Guildmaster.

21:21.137 --> 21:22.767
What, Glenda?

21:23.297 --> 21:26.717
In this business, guilds live 
and die by their reputations.

21:27.487 --> 21:29.697
We have to make an example of him

21:30.217 --> 21:34.597
and show everyone what happens to 
adventurers who defy the Beast's Fangs.

21:35.087 --> 21:38.277
Well, Lily? How was your 
first quest in two years?

21:41.117 --> 21:42.457
Not bad.

21:43.457 --> 21:45.747
Yeah? It was awesome, huh?

21:45.747 --> 21:48.617
I didn't say that! 
What's wrong with your hearing?!

21:48.617 --> 21:51.047
I heard your inner thoughts.

21:51.047 --> 21:53.447
I didn't <i>think</i> that, either!

21:53.447 --> 21:56.007
What's wrong with you? You're so annoying!

21:54.257 --> 21:56.007
Lily.

21:56.497 --> 21:58.657
It's been a while.

22:00.477 --> 22:03.257
